"entity": {
"name": "First Citizens BancShares, Inc.",
"description": "First Citizens BancShares, Inc. is a holding company, which engages in the provision of retail and commercial banking services through its subsidiaries. It operates through the following segments: General Banking, Commercial Banking, Rail, and Corporate. The General Banking segment delivers services to individuals through branch networks. The Commercial Banking segment provides lending, leasing and other financial and advisory services to small and middle market companies. The Rail segment deals with the provision of equipment leasing and secured financing for railroads and shippers. The Corporate segment consists of investment securities and interest bearing cash. The company was founded on August 7, 1986 and is headquartered in Raleigh, NC.",
